ot a negative if you believe that's a  negative then it's always going to hold  you back I don't know why people would  think that's a negative i do not want my  daughter's my sister's my wife to grow  up thinking that because they're women  they have a less chance of being  successful that's not the message i want  to put out there the message should be  because you're an entrepreneur you can  go out and create your own destiny and  yes it's hard running the business is  the hardest thing you ever going to do  in your life it's really really hard  there's a lot of things that are stacked  against you and you're going to have to  bust through them to become successful  but it has nothing to do with the fact  that you're a woman or any other excuse  that you're telling yourself  it's just a story if you change your  story you change your beliefs about  yourself you improve your confidence you  go out there and attack your goals  you're going to achieve success no  matter what statistics may tell you it's  on you good luck go do it guys deep  breath you got me angry anyway for those  of you watching video you liked it  please give me a thumbs up below I love  seeing those come in and I want to hear  you have to think okay let me hear your  thoughts leave a comment below and if  you have a question for your business  leave it in the comment section below i  love seeing those come in thank you guys  I love you guys I'll see you in the next  episode
 

